      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We have developed a trifunctional cleavable fluorescence turn-ON linker for chemoproteomic applications. This novel linker, which became highly fluorescent only upon cleavage of the azo bond, was successfully used for in situ proteome profiling/target identification and studies on newly synthesised proteomes."},
